on Avenue.","source_url":"https://www.coralgables.com/attractions/coral-gables-museum","source_title":"Coral Gables Museum | Coral Gables","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"At 285 Aragon Ave.; the City lists wheelchair access, guided tours, and Wi‑Fi.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"actors-playhouse-miracle-theatre","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Actors' Playhouse at the Miracle Theatre","title":"Actors' Playhouse at the Miracle Theatre","subtitle":"Miracle Mile corridor","notes":"Pick a musical, drama, or children’s program from the theater calendar, then arrive via the Miracle Mile block with nearby street parking and garages.","short_summary":"A performing-arts destination on Miracle Mile.","evidence_claim":"Actors’ Playhouse lists its venue at 280 Miracle Mile and identifies nearby street parking and garages in the Miracle Mile area.","source_url":"https://actorsplayhouse.org/visit/","source_title":"Visit Us - Actors' Playhouse at the Miracle Theatre","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"At 280 Miracle Mile; box-office hours are published on the venue’s visit page and can change for productions.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"giralda-plaza","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Giralda Plaza","title":"Giralda Plaza","subtitle":"Giralda Avenue corridor","notes":"Use the pedestrianized 100 block of Giralda Avenue as a short walking detour and choose among the documented restaurant or coffee-shop options there.","short_summary":"A pedestrian corridor lined with food and coffee businesses.","evidence_claim":"The City states that the 100 block of Giralda Avenue reopened as Giralda Plaza, a pedestrian walkway lined with restaurants, bars, and coffee shops.","source_url":"https://www.coralgables.com/attractions/giralda-plaza","source_title":"Giralda Plaza | Coral Gables","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The City identifies this as the 100 block of Giralda Ave.; select an all-ages restaurant or coffee shop.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"venetian-pool","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Venetian Pool","title":"Venetian Pool","subtitle":"De Soto Boulevard corridor","notes":"Reserve or check same-day availability before heading to De Soto Boulevard, then swim among the pool’s spring water, waterfalls, and cave-like grottos.","short_summary":"A public historic pool supplied by an underground aquifer.","evidence_claim":"The City says Venetian Pool is fed by spring water from an underground aquifer and features two waterfalls and cave-like grottos.","source_url":"https://www.coralgables.com/attractions/venetian-pool","source_title":"Venetian Pool | Coral Gables","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"At 2701 De Soto Blvd.; admission is ticketed, capacity can limit same-day entry, and alcohol is not permitted.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"biltmore-hotel","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"The Biltmore Hotel","title":"The Biltmore Hotel","subtitle":"Anastasia Avenue corridor","notes":"Walk the Anastasia Avenue approach to see the Mediterranean-style hotel architecture, then use the listed golf, tennis, spa, fitness, or dining facilities if desired.","short_summary":"A 1926-era landmark hotel with multiple documented facilities.","evidence_claim":"The City describes the Biltmore as a 271-room resort on more than 150 acres with Mediterranean architecture, golf, tennis, spa, fitness, and pool facilities.","source_url":"https://www.coralgables.com/attractions/biltmore-hotel","source_title":"The Biltmore Hotel | Coral Gables","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"At 1200 Anastasia Ave.; access to facilities and services may require a reservation or purchase.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"matheson-hammock-park-marina","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Matheson Hammock Park & Marina","title":"Matheson Hammock Park & Marina","subtitle":"Old Cutler Road corridor","notes":"Use the Old Cutler Road entrance for a nature-trail or picnic outing, and look for the tidal atoll pool and marina rather than treating the park as a pass-through.","short_summary":"A 630-acre park with trails, an atoll pool, and a marina.","evidence_claim":"The City identifies Matheson Hammock as a 630-acre urban park with a tidal atoll pool, marina, picnic pavilions, and nature trails.","source_url":"https://www.coralgables.com/attractions/matheson-hammock-park-marina","source_title":"Matheson Hammock Park & Marina | Coral Gables","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"At 9610 Old Cutler Road; the City lists vehicle entrance fees and daily hours of 8 a.m.–5 p.m.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fairchild-tropical-botanic-garden","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Fairchild Tropical Botanic Garden","title":"Fairchild Tropical Botanic Garden","subtitle":"Old Cutler Road corridor","notes":"Buy admission for a daytime walk through the garden’s tropical plant collections, then add the Wings of the Tropics butterfly exhibit to your route.","short_summary":"An 83-acre garden with tropical collections and a butterfly exhibit.","evidence_claim":"Fairchild states that it is at 10901 Old Cutler Road, is open daily 10 a.m.–5 p.m., and includes collections, exhibits, and Wings of the Tropics.","source_url":"https://fairchildgarden.org/visit/","source_title":"Visit Fairchild Tropical Botanic Garden","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"At 10901 Old Cutler Road; general admission is required for non-members and the garden is open daily except December 25.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
